{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Days until my due date?》是一款陪伴準媽媽度過孕期的倒數工具，提供預產期計算與倒數、每週孕期狀態、寶寶名字靈感、懷孕日記、星座預測及多項實用計算機，適合剛確認懷孕或進入最後倒數週數的家長使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-162.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>孕期倒數與貼心工具</h2>\n<p>應用由簡潔的預產期計算與倒數開始，讓使用者掌握孕期進度；亦可查看每週孕期狀態、以趣味生成器尋找寶寶名字靈感，並在懷孕日記記錄心情、夢想與飲食渴望。程式另提供星座預測、受孕日期估算、重要里程碑追蹤及大學儲蓄規劃計算，還有輕鬆小遊戲，協助整理孕期資訊與放鬆心情。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-149-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-150-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-151-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-152-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-153-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-154-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Days until my due date?</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/days-until-my-due-date/id725271047?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:27:17.572719+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:04:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:18:01.874960+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:20:33.874744+00:00","content_hash":"aac1f012607595fc18f6732b3d4111737d0082bde124498c3898bbad42f7ddaa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}